20
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Enable. Capture. Establish.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Build. Operate.

22
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,200
Every commitment becomes the ground

23
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,300
